note placeholder_zeroed_when_unavailable keyring.epochs_available qualifies the three keyring.active_epoch_* values; snapshot.id_available qualifies snapshot.snapshot_id and snapshot.reason; health.status_available, rollback.last_advance_source_available and freshness.key_epoch_available each qualify the one value after them. Every claim is fixed width and written as zero when its flag is 0, not the caller's raw value; zero beside flag 0 is not a reading, and a valid 0 (a reason, a status) beside flag 1 is
